{
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "assetName": "ComChay_after_table_click",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"…Why can’t I stop thinking about what Fendory said?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Tch. These notifications won’t stop either.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You look exhausted, dear.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"…Just give me anything warm.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"No problem. Sit down first. Rain like this makes people think too much.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I’m not here to think. Just food.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Then warm food it is.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "ComChay_after_visual_scan",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"The rice has a deep golden crust around the edges.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Some spots are darker, but not burnt in a careless way.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"There’s a light glaze sitting on top, like the seasoning was brushed in slowly.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It looks simple, but the surface has warmth.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Not restaurant-polished. More like something made carefully for someone.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "ComChay_after_sound_scan",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"The first touch gives a clean crackle.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Then underneath that, the grains break apart in small, uneven bits.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It’s not a fancy texture, but it feels honest.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Crisp on the outside, rough and warm inside.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"…That sound reminds me of something.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "ComChay_before_report",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"Okay… I think I understand this dish.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The crust gives it that dry snap first.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Then the broken grains spread the seasoning in little bursts.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"There’s a gentle sweetness under it, but the salty edge keeps it grounded.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It isn’t trying to impress me.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It just feels… familiar.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"That should be enough for the report.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "ComChay_after_correct_submit",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"…Cơm cháy?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It’s my son’s favorite dish. I always make it when he comes home.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"…This taste…\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Hm?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It reminds me of home.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Food tastes best when it’s made with care.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"…When did I stop loving food?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "ComChay_after_wrong_submit",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"Dear, that sounds like you’re forcing an answer.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Food this simple doesn’t need to be bullied into sounding important.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"…Maybe I’m overthinking it.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Look again. Listen again.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The crust, the grains, and the seasoning are already telling you enough.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}